  "html": "<article id=\"post-6717\" class=\"container post-6717 page type-page status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow center-content-mobile full-width-mobile has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-red-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-info\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-2\">HVAC, Plumbing &amp; Indoor Air Quality Services in Cary, NC&nbsp;</h1>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services provides heating, cooling, plumbing, and indoor air quality&nbsp;service&nbsp;across Cary and western Wake County, quoting every job upfront and answering calls 24/7. Much of Cary went up in the building waves of the 1980s through the 2000s, and equipment installed in those years is now reaching the end of its working life street by street.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">That timing is the defining fact of home service in Cary. Original heat pumps in MacGregor Downs, first-generation AC units in Preston, and builder-installed water heaters in Amberly are aging out on&nbsp;roughly the&nbsp;same&nbsp;schedule, and&nbsp;replacing them on your own timeline costs less stress than replacing them during a July failure. We help homeowners plan those upgrades instead of reacting to them.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-1 full-width-mobile is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"badge mb-3\" style='min-height:unset;'>\n    <div class=\"badge__content\">\n        <svg width=\"45\" height=\"45\" viewBox=\"0 0 45 45\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <title>Google</title>\n            <path d=\"M42.0046 22.9145C42.0046 21.4661 41.8746 20.0733 41.6332 18.7363H22.395V26.647H33.3882C32.9054 29.191 31.457 31.3451 29.2844 32.7935V37.9373H35.9137C39.7762 34.372 42.0046 29.1353 42.0046 22.9145Z\" fill=\"#4285F4\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 42.8766C27.9112 42.8766 32.535 41.0568 35.9147 37.9371L29.2854 32.7933C27.4655 34.0189 25.1443 34.7617 22.396 34.7617C17.0851 34.7617 12.5727 31.1777 10.9571 26.3496H4.16064V31.6234C7.52175 38.2899 14.4111 42.8766 22.396 42.8766Z\" fill=\"#34A853\"/>\n            <path d=\"M10.9608 26.3308C10.5523 25.1052 10.3109 23.8053 10.3109 22.4498C10.3109 21.0942 10.5523 19.7943 10.9608 18.5687V13.2949H4.16436C2.77164 16.0432 1.97314 19.1444 1.97314 22.4498C1.97314 25.7551 2.77164 28.8563 4.16436 31.6046L9.45671 27.4821L10.9608 26.3308Z\" fill=\"#FBBC05\"/>\n            <path d=\"M22.396 10.155C25.4043 10.155 28.0783 11.1949 30.2138 13.2004L36.0633 7.35097C32.5165 4.04557 27.9112 2.02148 22.396 2.02148C14.4111 2.02148 7.52175 6.60818 4.16064 13.2933L10.9571 18.567C12.5727 13.7389 17.0851 10.155 22.396 10.155Z\" fill=\"#EA4335\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container\">\n            <p class=\"h6 badge__content__rating-container__title\">Google Rating</p>\n            <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars\">\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__number\">\n                    5                </div>\n                <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container\">\n                    <div class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"badge__content__rating-container__stars__container__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"/images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"The entrance of Happy Home Heating and Cooling in Durham, NC\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/11/NU-HappyHome_Stock-9-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-secondary-inverse-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wrap-mobile flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 is-horizontal is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-cdbf0242 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-db3ccc14 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cooling and Heating for Growth-Era Homes&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cary summers keep air conditioners running from May into October, and the winters swing enough to demand real heating capacity. Gas&nbsp;service reaches&nbsp;most of&nbsp;town, so homes run heat pumps, gas furnaces, and hybrid pairings in&nbsp;roughly equal&nbsp;measure.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/cooling/air-conditioning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Conditioning Services in Cary</strong></a>&nbsp;Systems installed during the 1990s and 2000s booms are now prime candidates for replacement, and we walk you through the repair-versus-replace decision with real numbers rather than a sales pitch. Installation, repair, and tune-ups cover every major brand.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/heating\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Heating Services in Cary</strong></a>&nbsp;We install, repair, and&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;heat pumps, gas furnaces, and&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/cooling/dual-fuel-hybrid-systems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">dual-fuel hybrid systems</a>&nbsp;that switch fuel sources automatically as temperatures move. Our&nbsp;<a href=\"/maintenance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">maintenance plans</a>&nbsp;keep both seasons covered on one schedule.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/cooling/mini-split\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Ductless Mini-Split Systems</strong></a>&nbsp;The bonus room over the garage is the most&nbsp;complained-about room in Cary, too hot in July and too cold in January.&nbsp;A mini-split conditions that one space directly, with no new ductwork.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indoor Air Quality for Tightly Built Homes&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Newer construction seals tightly, which saves energy and traps moisture and stale air in equal&nbsp;measure. Combined with a pollen season that&nbsp;coats&nbsp;the whole Triangle, Cary homes benefit from mechanical air quality solutions.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/dehumidifiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Whole-Home Dehumidifiers</strong></a>: Managed humidity keeps a tightly sealed house from turning muggy in August and eases the cooling load.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality/air-ducts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Duct Cleaning and Sealing</strong></a>: Even newer ductwork leaks air and gathers dust. Sealing and cleaning recovers efficiency and&nbsp;stops the recirculation.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality/air-purifiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Air Filtration and Purification</strong></a>: High-efficiency filtration takes the edge&nbsp;off spring&nbsp;pollen indoors, where families&nbsp;actually spend&nbsp;the season.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plumbing Service Across Cary&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cary treats its own water from Jordan Lake, and it reaches the tap&nbsp;relatively soft, so softeners rarely make sense in town. The recurring plumbing story here involves fixtures and water heaters installed at construction and now quietly aging out together.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-heater-installation-replacements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Water Heater Installation and Replacement</strong></a>&nbsp;A water heater set during a neighborhood&#8217;s construction is often well past warranty today and prone to failing without notice. We replace tank units, install&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/tankless-water-heaters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">tankless systems</a>&nbsp;for households that want endless hot water, and handle&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-heater-repairs-maintenance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">repairs and maintenance</a>&nbsp;on units with life left in them.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/frozen-burst-pipe-repair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Frozen and Burst Pipe Repair</strong></a>&nbsp;Triangle freezes&nbsp;find&nbsp;under-insulated lines fast. We stop the water, repair the break, and help you protect vulnerable runs before the next cold snap.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/plumbing/kitchen-bathroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Kitchen and Bathroom Plumbing</strong></a>&nbsp;Updating a 1990s builder-grade bathroom or fixing a leak in a new build, our licensed plumbers handle faucets, disposals, toilets, and fixtures with the price set first. Homeowners who want&nbsp;better-tasting&nbsp;water at the tap can add&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-treatment-filtration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">filtration</a>&nbsp;sized to the household.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Planning Ahead&nbsp;With&nbsp;Cary Homeowners&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For homes reaching replacement age, we lay out options and pricing&nbsp;early&nbsp;so upgrades happen on your schedule rather than on the hottest day of the year. Every quote is presented before work begins, backed by honest, upfront pricing and a 100% money-back guarantee, and our trained technicians keep current on the systems going into Cary homes today. Call or book online to start the conversation.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"accordion\" style=\"--_accordion-separator-color: #076395\">\n            <details class=\"accordion-item\" data-custom-open=\"true\" open>\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Do you handle after-hours AC and plumbing failures in Cary? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Yes. Calls are answered 24/7 across Cary and western Wake County, and active failures get priority dispatch regardless of the hour.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">My Cary home&#8217;s AC is original to the house. Should I repair or replace it? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Many systems from the 1990s and 2000s construction waves are now at replacement age, and a new high-efficiency unit often pays part of its way in lower energy bills. When a repair genuinely makes more sense, that is what we recommend, and we show you the numbers behind either path.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">Is a water softener worthwhile on Cary&#8217;s water? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>Rarely. Jordan Lake water arrives treated and relatively soft, so a softener adds little for most Cary homes. Filtration for taste at the tap is the upgrade homeowners usually want instead.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">What can be done about a bonus room that never holds temperature? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p>A ductless mini-split is the direct fix. It conditions the problem room independently of the main system, so the rest of the house stays balanced while the bonus room finally holds its setpoint.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>            <details class=\"accordion-item\">\n            <summary class=\"accordion-title | paired-icon-text\">\n                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--closed | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevrondown\" /></svg>                <svg class=\"icon accordion-icon accordion-icon--open | paired-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronup\" /></svg>                <p class=\"paired-text\">What communities around Cary do you also serve? </p>\n            </summary>\n\n            <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n                <div class=\"accordion-content-inner\">\n                    <p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW25372893 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW25372893 BCX0\">Raleigh, Durham, and Chapel Hill are all within our territory. The Service Areas menu lists every town we cover.</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW25372893 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:140}\"> </span></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </details>    </div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow py-5\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Powered by NearU — We’re here to make your HVAC Service experience the best one yet!</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"430\" height=\"98\" src=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png\" alt=\"NearU\" class=\"wp-image-36\" style=\"width:220px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png 430w, /images/2024/02/NearU-300x68.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 100vw, 430px\" /></figure>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">NearU is setting up a new standard of HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our companies with better resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. If you’ve recently learned that your go-to HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator company has joined NearU, then this is something to get excited about! We protect the people and culture that make each company great, while ensuring their customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-6717 -->"
}